// S5 timers: SP, SE, SD, SS, SF with S5T#2S; L and LC of the SD timer; a
// timer by a tag of the type Timer; a block in German (SE is the on delay)
tag S1 Bool %I0.0
tag S2 Bool %I0.1
tag S3 Bool %I0.2
tag S4 Bool %I0.3
tag S5 Bool %I0.4
tag Rs Bool %I0.5
tag Q1 Bool %Q0.0
tag Q2 Bool %Q0.1
tag Q3 Bool %Q0.2
tag Q4 Bool %Q0.3
tag Q5 Bool %Q0.4
tag Q6 Bool %Q0.5
tag Q7 Bool %Q0.6
tag V1 Word %MW10
tag V2 Word %MW12
tag Tm Timer %T7
A S1
L s5:2000
SP T 1
A T 1
= Q1
---
A S2
L s5:2000
SE T 2
A T 2
= Q2
---
A S3
L s5:2000
SD T 3
A T 3
= Q3
L T 3
T V1
LC T 3
T V2
---
A S4
L s5:2000
SS T 4
A Rs
R T 4
A T 4
= Q4
---
A S5
L s5:2000
SF T 5
A T 5
= Q5
---
A S3
L s5:2000
SD Tm
A Tm
= Q7
CALL call:German
block German FC
U S3
L s5:2000
SE T 6
U T 6
= Q6
